{% comment %}
  Flavour world key for a product — one of just-orange / grape / blue-rizz /
  punch for a LIFTD product. Single source for every section that sets
  data-liftd-world or looks up liftd-flavour-copy.

  Uses the custom.flavour_world metafield when set; otherwise the handle,
  with any strength suffix removed. The 5MG products kept the original
  handles (`grape`); the 10MG products are `grape-4-pack-10mg-thc`, so a
  raw handle would miss the world and drop the colour takeover.

  Usage (capture, then strip):
    {%- capture world -%}{%- render 'liftd-world', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign world = world | strip -%}
{% endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign world = product.metafields.custom.flavour_world.value | default: product.handle
  assign world = world | remove: '-4-pack-10mg-thc' | remove: '-4-pack-5mg-thc' | remove: '-10mg-thc' | remove: '-5mg-thc'
  echo world
-%}
